yat / Be-ilmi","translations":{"en":"Ignorance / Pre-Islamic Ignorance","ur":"جاہلیت / بے علمی","hi":"जाहिलियत / अज्ञानता"}},{"id":"s1l5_g1_w26","arabic":"النِّعْمَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">النِّعْمَة</span>","hinglish":"Ne'mat","translations":{"en":"Blessing / Favor","ur":"نعمت","hi":"नेअमत"}},{"id":"s1l5_g1_w27","arabic":"الْعَاقِبَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعَاقِبَة</span>","hinglish":"Anjam / Aaqibat","translations":{"en":"Final Outcome / End","ur":"انجام / عاقبت","hi":"अंजाम / आक़िबत"}},{"id":"s1l5_g1_w28","arabic":"الْاِتِّبَاع","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْاِتِّبَاع</span>","hinglish":"Pairawi / Piche chalna","translations":{"en":"Following / Obedience","ur":"پیروی / پیچھے چلنا","hi":"पैरवी / अनुसरण"}},{"id":"s1l5_g1_w29","arabic":"الْخَطَأ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْخَطَأ</span>","hinglish":"Khata / Galti","translations":{"en":"Mistake / Error","ur":"خطا / غلطی","hi":"ख़ता / गलती"}},{"id":"s1l5_g1_w30","arabic":"الشَّرِيعَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشَّرِيعَة</span>","hinglish":"Shariat / Rasta","translations":{"en":"Sacred Law / Way","ur":"شریعت / راستہ","hi":"शरीअत / सीधा रास्ता"}},{"id":"s1l5_g1_w31","arabic":"الْأُمّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْأُمّ</span>","hinglish":"Maan","translations":{"en":"Mother","ur":"ماں / والدہ","hi":"माँ / माता"}},{"id":"s1l5_g1_w32","arabic":"الْحَيّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَيّ</span>","hinglish":"Zinda","translations":{"en":"The Living / Alive","ur":"زندہ / حی","hi":"ज़िंदा / जीवित"}},{"id":"s1l5_g1_w33","arabic":"الْمَيِّت","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَيِّت</span>","hinglish":"Murdah / Mayyit","translations":{"en":"The Dead","ur":"مردہ / میت","hi":"मुर्दा / मृत"}},{"id":"s1l5_g1_w34","arabic":"الْعَبْد","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعَبْد</span>","hinglish":"Banda / Ghulam","translations":{"en":"Servant / Slave","ur":"بندہ / غلام","hi":"बंदा / ग़ुलाम"}},{"id":"s1l5_g1_w35","arabic":"الشَّيْء","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشَّيْء</span>","hinglish":"Cheez","translations":{"en":"Thing","ur":"چیز","hi":"चीज़ / वस्तु"}},{"id":"s1l5_g1_w36","arabic":"الزَّلْزَلَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الزَّلْزَلَة</span>","hinglish":"Zalzala","translations":{"en":"Earthquake / Shaking","ur":"زلزلہ","hi":"ज़लज़ला / भूकंप"}}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s1l5_r2","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Kya aapne kabhi socha hai ke kitne 'parhe likhe Musalman' apni poori zindagi Qur'an ko samajhne ki koshish kiye baghair guzaar dete hain. Aaj apne aap se ahad karein ke aap Arabi seekhne ki jadd-o-jehad karenge taake Allah Ta'ala ka paigham samajh sakein. In Sha' Allah!","hinglish_text":"Kya aapne kabhi socha hai ke kitne 'parhe likhe Musalman' apni poori zindagi Qur'an ko samajhne ki koshish kiye baghair guzaar dete hain. Aaj apne aap se ahad karein ke aap Arabi seekhne ki jadd-o-jehad karenge taake Allah Ta'ala ka paigham samajh sakein. mein Sha Allah!"}},{"id":"sec_s1l5_lbl3","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"**Exercise (Practice):** Darj zail Qur'ani aayaton mein se un alfaaz ko highlight karein jinhe aap mukammal taur par samajhte hain:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l5_v4","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s1l5_v4_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"وَلَا يُشْرِكْ بِعِبَادَةِ رَبِّهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يُشْرِكْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">عِبَادَةِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّهِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur apne Rabb ki ibadat mein kisi ko shareek na kare","translations":{"ur":"اور اپنے رب کی عبادت میں کسی کو شریک نہ کرے","en":"And not associate anyone in the worship of his Lord","hi":"और अपने रब की इबादत में किसी को शरीक न करे"},"ref":"18:110"},{"id":"s1l5_v4_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"الطَّلَاقُ مَرَّتَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الطَّلَاقُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَرَّت</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َانِ</span>","hinglish":"Talaq do baar hai","translations":{"ur":"طلاق دو بار ہے","en":"Divorce is twice","hi":"तलाक़ दो बार है"},"ref":"2:229"},{"id":"s1l5_v4_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"وَاذْكُرُوا نِعْمَةَ اللهِ عَلَيْكُمْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَاذْكُر</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُوا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نِعْمَةَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللهِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَيْكُمْ</span>","hinglish":"Aur apne upar Allah ki ne'mat ko yaad karo","translations":{"ur":"اور اپنے اوپر اللہ کی نعمت کو یاد کرو","en":"And remember the favor of Allah upon you","hi":"और अपने ऊपर अल्लाह की नेमत को याद करो"},"ref":"5:7"},{"id":"s1l5_v4_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"بَدَّلُوا نِعْمَةَ اللهِ كُفْرًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بَدَّل</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُوا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نِعْمَةَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللهِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">كُفْرًا</span>","hinglish":"Unhon ne Allah ki ne'mat ko kufr se badal diya","translations":{"ur":"انہوں نے اللہ کی نعمت کو کفر سے بدل دیا","en":"They exchanged the favor of Allah for disbelief","hi":"उन्होंने अल्लाह की नेमत को कुफ़्र से बदल दिया"},"ref":"14:28"},{"id":"s1l5_v4_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"وَجَعَلُوا بَيْنَهُ وَبَيْنَ الْجِنَّةِ نَسَبًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَجَعَل</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُوا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيْنَهُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَبَيْنَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">جِنَّةِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَسَبًا</span>","hinglish":"Aur unhon ne uske (Allah ke) aur jinnat ke darmiyan rishta bana liya","translations":{"ur":"اور انہوں نے اس کے (اللہ کے) اور جنات کے درمیان رشتہ بنا لیا","en":"And they have claimed between Him and the jinn a lineage","hi":"और उन्होंने उसके (अल्लाह के) और जिन्नात के दरम्यान रिश्ता बना लिया"},"ref":"37:158"},{"id":"s1l5_v4_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"وَالْوَزْنُ يَوْمَئِذٍ الْحَقُّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">وَالْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">وَزْنُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَوْمَئِذٍ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">حَقُّ</span>","hinglish":"Aur us din wazn (tolna) bar-haq hoga","translations":{"en":"And the weighing on that Day will be the truth","ur":"اس دن لوگ گروہ در گروہ نکلیں گے","hi":"उस दिन लोग गिरोह दर गिरोह निकलेंगे"},"ref":"7:8"},{"id":"s1l5_v4_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"ادْخُلُوا الْجَنَّةَ لَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْكُمْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">ادْخُل</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُوا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">جَنَّةَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَوْفٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَيْكُمْ</span>","hinglish":"Jannat mein dakhil ho jao, tum par koi khawf nahin","translations":{"ur":"جنت میں داخل ہو جاؤ، تم پر کوئی خوف نہیں","en":"Enter Paradise; no fear will there be concerning you","hi":"जन्नत में दाख़िल हो जाओ, तुम पर कोई ख़ौफ़ नहीं"},"ref":"7:49"},{"id":"s1l5_v4_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"وَجَنَّةٍ عَرْضُهَا كَعَرْضِ السَّمَاءِ وَالْأَرْضِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَجَنَّةٍ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَرْضُهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">كَعَرْضِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّمَاءِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَالْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">أَرْضِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur aisi jannat jiski chau-daai aasmaan aur zameen ki chau-daai ki tarah hai","translations":{"ur":"اور ایسی جنت جس کی چوڑائی آسمان اور زمین کی چوڑائی کی طرح ہے","en":"And a Garden whose width is like the width of the heaven and earth","hi":"और ऐसी जन्नत जिसकी चौड़ाई आसमान और ज़मीन की चौड़ाई की तरह है"},"ref":"57:21"},{"id":"s1l5_v4_s9","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"جَعَلْنَاكَ عَلَى شَرِيعَةٍ مِنَ الْأَمْرِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">جَعَلْنَاكَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَرِيعَةٍ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">أَمْرِ</span>","hinglish":"Hamne aap ko deen ke ek khule raste (shariat) par qaaim kiya","translations":{"ur":"ہم نے آپ کو دین کے ایک کھلے راستے (شریعت) پر قائم کیا","en":"We have put you on an ordained way concerning the matter of religion","hi":"हमने आपको दीन के एक खुले रास्ते (शरीअत) पर क़ायम किया"},"ref":"45:18"},{"id":"s1l5_v4_s10","sentence_number":10,"arabic":"لَهُمْ مَغْفِرَةٌ وَأَجْرٌ عَظِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَهُمْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَغْفِرَةٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأَجْرٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَظِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Unke liye maghfirat aur bada ajr hai","translations":{"ur":"ان کے لیے مغفرت اور بڑا اجر ہے","en":"For them is forgiveness and a great reward","hi":"उनके लिए मग़फ़िरत और बड़ा अज्र है"},"ref":"5:9"},{"id":"s1l5_v4_s11","sentence_number":11,"arabic":"فَاتِّبَاعٌ بِالْمَعْرُوفِ وَأَدَاءٌ إِلَيْهِ بِإِحْسَانٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَاتِّبَاعٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بِالْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">مَعْرُوفِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأَدَاءٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَيْهِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">إِحْسَانٍ</span>","hinglish":"To dastoor ke mutabiq pairawi karna aur achhi tarah (diyat) ada karna","translations":{"ur":"تو دستور کے مطابق پیروی کرنا اور اچھی طرح (دیت) ادا کرنا","en":"Then pursue with what is acceptable and pay with good conduct","hi":"तो दस्तूर के मुताबिक़ पैरवी करना और अच्छी तरह (दियत) अदा करना"},"ref":"2:178"},{"id":"s1l5_v4_s12","sentence_number":12,"arabic":"يَظُنُّونَ بِاللهِ غَيْرَ الْحَقِّ ظَنَّ الْجَاهِلِيَّةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">يَظُنُّونَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">اللهِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">غَيْرَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">حَقِّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ظَنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">جَاهِلِيَّةِ</span>","hinglish":"Woh Allah ke baare mein na-haq jahiliyyat ka gumaan karte hain","translations":{"ur":"وہ اللہ کے بارے میں ناحق جاہلیت کا گمان کرتے ہیں","en":"Thinking of Allah other than the truth — the thought of ignorance","hi":"वे अल्लाह के बारे में नाहक़ जाहिलियत का गुमान करते हैं"},"ref":"3:154"}],"cols":3}}]}}